Thu Sep 24 12:30:00 UTC 2026 - Houge Langley <hougelangley1987@gmail.com>

- Add build targets: openSUSE Leap 16.0 (x86_64, aarch64) and
  aarch64/riscv64 architectures for openSUSE Tumbleweed.
  Note: Leap 16.0 has no official riscv64 port, so riscv64 is
  Tumbleweed-only.

