Thu Sep 24 08:00:00 UTC 2026 - Houge Langley <hougelangley1987@gmail.com>

- Fix: enable QtWebEngine so the in-app login window works.
  Tumbleweed does provide qt6-webenginewidgets-devel; the earlier
  "not available" conclusion came from a wrong zypper query and led to
  an unnecessary degradation. Now consistent with Arch/Fedora builds.

