Wed Sep 23 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - Houge Langley <hougelangley1987@gmail.com>

- Initial OBS package for openSUSE Tumbleweed (hov-qt 1.2.1)
- Qt6 desktop client: libmpv playback / yt-dlp + ffmpeg downloads / QtWebEngine
- WebEngine disabled in this build: Tumbleweed does not ship
